# Project structure

project-root/
├── CLAUDE.md                    # Loaded every session — project overview, stack, commands
├── .mcp.json                    # MCP server config, committed, shared with team
├── .gitignore                   # must exclude settings.local.json (see below)
└── .claude/
    ├── settings.json            # permissions, model, hooks — committed
    ├── settings.local.json      # personal overrides — NEVER committed
    ├── rules/                   # path-scoped, only loads when matching files are touched
    │   ├── code-style.md
    │   ├── testing.md
    │   └── api-conventions.md
    ├── commands/                # slash commands — always available, not path-gated
    │   ├── review.md
    │   └── fix-issue.md
    ├── skills/                  # progressive disclosure — loads only on task match
    │   └── deploy/
    │       ├── SKILL.md
    │       └── deploy-config.md
    ├── agents/                  # subagents, isolated context windows
    │   ├── code-reviewer.md
    │   └── security-auditor.md
    └── hooks/                   # pre/post tool-use scripts
        └── validate-bash.sh

~/.claude/                       # USER-LEVEL, global, loads before project-level
├── CLAUDE.md                    # personal instructions across all projects
├── settings.json                # personal defaults (model, permissions)
└── rules/
    └── preferences.md           # loads before project rules; project rules take precedence on conflict

## Check list

### WordBuddy monorepo — Claude Code config verification

- [ ] Old `.claude/` folders removed from `WordBuddy/` and `WordBuddy.UI/` subfolders
- [ ] Single `.claude/` exists at RootFolder only
- [ ] `claude` started from RootFolder, not from a subfolder
- [ ] `/permissions` in REPL shows merged deny/ask/allow list (both BE and FE entries present)
- [ ] `dotnet build` runs without a permission prompt (allow rule works)
- [ ] `npm run build` runs without a permission prompt (allow rule works)
- [ ] `git push` stops and asks for confirmation (ask rule works)
- [ ] Attempting to read `WordBuddy/appsettings.Production.json` is blocked (deny rule works)
- [ ] Attempting to read `WordBuddy.UI/.env` is blocked (deny rule works)
- [ ] `.claude/logs/audit.jsonl` contains entries after a few tool calls (hook works)
- [ ] `/memory` shows `rules/safety-guardrails.md` loaded unconditionally
- [ ] `/memory` shows `rules/backend.md` loaded only after touching a `.cs` file
- [ ] `/memory` shows `rules/frontend.md` loaded only after touching a `.tsx` file
- [ ] `.claude/settings.local.json` is NOT tracked by git (`git status` doesn't show it)
